gr-soarr is a GNU Radio out-of-tree module implementing the ground-station
side of a CCSDS Telecommand (TC) uplink chain for ARIS's SOARR mission. All
blocks are written in Python. The Python namespace is 'gnuradio.soarr',
imported as:

    from gnuradio import soarr

In GNU Radio Companion the blocks appear under the [soarr] category.

A quick listing of the available blocks and their parameters is available
in Python after importing, using:

    help(soarr)

For the TX/RX pipeline, per-block documentation, and build/test setup, see
docs/README.md in the source tree.
